<Legal title="Accessibility" description="Accessibility statement for nathan-lallier.com.">
  <Fragment slot="titre"><span class="highlight">Accessibility</span></Fragment>
<p class="lead">Nathan LALLIER is committed to making this website accessible, in accordance with Article 47 of French Law No. 2005-102 of 11 February 2005. This is an English translation provided for convenience. The <a href="/accessibilite" hreflang="fr" lang="fr">French version</a> is the legally binding one.</p>
<section class="card legal-card">
  <h2><span class="legal-num">1</span>Compliance status</h2>
  <div class="legal-content"><p><a href="/en">nathan-lallier.com</a> is <strong>partially compliant</strong> with the French accessibility standard RGAA version 4.1.</p><div class="conformity-badge"><span>Partially compliant, RGAA 4.1</span></div><p>Accessibility is improved continuously so that everyone can use the website comfortably.</p></div>
</section>
<section class="card legal-card">
  <h2><span class="legal-num">2</span>Accessibility features</h2>
  <div class="legal-content"><p>This website includes the following features:</p><div class="features-grid"><div class="feature-item"><div class="feature-text"><strong>High contrast</strong> Colours chosen for good readability</div></div><div class="feature-item"><div class="feature-text"><strong>Semantic HTML</strong> Logical structure for screen readers</div></div><div class="feature-item"><div class="feature-text"><strong>Alternative text</strong> Images described for assistive technologies</div></div><div class="feature-item"><div class="feature-text"><strong>Responsive design</strong> Works on every device and screen size</div></div><div class="feature-item"><div class="feature-text"><strong>Font sizes</strong> Readable, resizable text</div></div><div class="feature-item"><div class="feature-text"><strong>Keyboard navigation</strong> The whole site can be used with a keyboard</div></div></div></div>
</section>
<section class="card legal-card">
  <h2><span class="legal-num">3</span>Known limitations</h2>
  <div class="legal-content"><p>Some content may have accessibility limitations:</p><ul><li>Some PDF documents may not be fully accessible</li><li>Some third-party content (embedded widgets) may not be fully accessible</li></ul><p>These points are being worked on to improve overall accessibility.</p></div>
</section>
<section class="card legal-card">
  <h2><span class="legal-num">4</span>Technologies used</h2>
  <div class="legal-content"><p>The accessibility of this website relies on:</p><ul><li>HTML5</li><li>CSS3</li><li>JavaScript</li><li>WAI-ARIA (Web Accessibility Initiative, Accessible Rich Internet Applications)</li></ul><p>These technologies work with the most common browsers and assistive technologies.</p></div>
</section>
<section class="card legal-card">
  <h2><span class="legal-num">5</span>Feedback and contact</h2>
  <div class="legal-content"><p>If you encounter an accessibility issue on this website or want to report a problem, please get in touch.</p><p>I will reply as soon as possible and look for a solution that suits your situation.</p><div class="contact-badge"><div class="contact-badge-text"><strong>Accessibility contact</strong><br/><a href="mailto:contact@nathan-lallier.com">contact@nathan-lallier.com</a></div></div></div>
</section>
<section class="card legal-card">
  <h2><span class="legal-num">6</span>Remedies</h2>
  <div class="legal-content"><p>If you report an accessibility issue that prevents you from accessing content or a feature and do not receive a response, you may:</p><ul><li>Contact the <a href="https://formulaire.defenseurdesdroits.fr/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Défenseur des droits</a> (French Rights Defender)</li><li>Write to: Défenseur des droits, Libre réponse 71120, 75342 Paris CEDEX 07, France</li></ul></div>
</section>
</Legal>
